        "id": "2064394146916229443",
        "text": "Introducing Claude Fable 5: a Mythos-class model that we’ve made safe for general use.\n\nIts capabilities exceed those of any model we’ve ever made generally available. https://t.co/2AvmEjHIX8",
        "author": {
